# Development Tools

## Testing

### Unit Tests

- Unit tests for helpers, hooks, or components in isolation.
- Co-locate with file under test: `[NameOfComponent].unit.spec.ts`.
- No test framework configured yet; consult before adding one.
- Quality over quantity.

## Node / JS / TypeScript

- Use npm for package management.

## Typing and Linting

- Prettier for formatting.
- Do not use type `any`.
